              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naamöteebhiri iga, Uni nu uni ÖMÖNENE, tateebhia Bharao ömögambi wa Misiri gaara gonsui nkögöteebhia.",
          "type": "text",
